  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan Education Cluster Coordinator</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial support for a UNICEF temporary Subnational Education Cluster Coordinator. The position will support Darfur, Sudan for six months (through Standby Personnel). The aim of this post is to ensure a coherent and effective response to education needs by agencies engaging in Education in this region. The post holder will work closely with education stakeholders (children, families, communities, authorities, education institutions and INGOs and UN agencies) to provide an effective, timely and strategic collective response to the current situation.</narrative>
  </description>
